  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multilateral education aid architecture study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Produce a study on the multilateral education aid architecture, with a focus on Education in Emergencies and Protracted Crises (EiEPC). The study will map multilateral support, assess institutional effectiveness, and provide recommendations for improving coherence, efficiency, and sustainability in the global education aid system.  This study is commissioned by FCDO in partnership with four other donors, will form a small steering group.</narrative>
  </description>
